        "question_type": "Objective",
        "exam_year": "2022",
        "question_text": "<p>A half-wave rectifier converts an AC input voltage of $V_{in} = 10 \\sin(\\omega t)$ V to a DC output. What is the average output voltage if the diode is ideal?</p>",
